 -->\n（可选：最新完整 plan.md 或摘要）\n<!-- shineai-exit-plan:end -->\n\n系统会弹出审批。用户批准后 Plan 按钮关闭，下一轮进入执行。",zr="当前处于 Plan 执行阶段：已有经 Plan 模式确认的规划文档，请以会话绑定的 plan 文档（路径见下文）作为单一主要依据执行，不要盲找仓库根或 `.claude/plans`。\n\n【执行要求】\n- 按 plan 文档的步骤 / Checklist 推进，优先完成未完成项。\n- 如果需要重大偏离该 plan 文档，请先说明原因、影响和新的执行建议。\n- 不要另起一套无关规划文件（例如 .claude/plans、Codex 内置 plan/todo）作为主依据；如工具产生临时计划，只能作为辅助。\n- 执行过程中可更新任务状态，但不要忽略或覆盖 ShineAI 会话绑定的 plan 文档。",Qr="session:status-change",Hr="session:activity",Wr="session:intervention",Gr="session:name-change",Vr="session:conversation-message",Yr="prototype:sync-pages",Xr="office:switch-instance",Kr="surface-window:changed",Jr="window:fullscreen-changed",Zr="task:status-change",ea="provider:changed",ta="voice:stream:error",ra="voice:wake",aa="assistant:chat",sa="assistant:confirm-reply",ia="assistant:ui-command",na="data-path:migration-progress",oa="mcp:install-progress",ca="quick-action:shell-output",la="quick-action:shell-exit",da="skill:installed-notify",ua="credit:get-balance",pa="credit:get-transactions",ha="credit:get-summary",ma="promoter:get-profile",ga="promoter:get-config",fa="promoter:get-rewards",ya="promoter:get-stats",va="quota:get",ba="quota:usage",Aa="quota:models",ka="plan:get-status",wa="scheduler:task-updated",_a="scheduler:task-completed",Sa="scheduler:task-failed",Ia="butler:float-window-opened",Ea="butler:navigate-session",Ta="butler-assistant:message",xa="butler-assistant:action-updated",Ca="browser:ensure-pane",Ma="proposals:list",Pa="proposals:resolve",Ra="directions:map",Oa="workGroups:background-model",Da="autonomy:get",Na="autonomy:set",Ba="session-deltas:";function La(a02){return''+Ba+a02;}const Fa="scheduler:list-tasks",$a="scheduler:create-task",ja="scheduler:update-task",Ua="scheduler:delete-task",qa="scheduler:toggle-task",za="scheduler:trigger-now",Qa="scheduler:get-history",Ha="scheduler:cancel-run",Wa=wa,Ga="scheduler:task-started",Va=_a,Ya=Sa,Xa="scheduler:run-started",Ka="hook:get-access",Ja="hook:list",Za="hook:get",es="hook:create",t